OL,3,GNEWSAThree jailed as part of people
OL,4,Asmuggling gang bust
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men were sentenced at Canterbury
OL,7,FCrown Court on Wednesday for helping
OL,8,Fpeople enter France illegally.
OL,10,FShuhal Ahmed, Robiul Islam and Qasim
OL,11,FJan were part of a gang of 21 people
OL,12,Fsmugglers who hid people in lorries to
OL,13,Ftransport them from the UK to France
OL,14,Fthrough Dover.
OL,16,FA National Crime Agency spokesperson
OL,17,F(NCA) said the gang was sentenced to a
OL,18,Fcombined total of 84 years and the
OL,19,Finvestigation covered 10 different
OL,20,Fsmuggling runs between July 2025 and
OL,21,FJanuary 2026.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
