OL,3,GNEWSAThree jailed as part of people
OL,4,Asmuggling gang bust
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe migrants paid around #1400 to enter
OL,7,FFrance and most were in the UK legally
OL,8,Fat the time but were trying to avoid
OL,9,Frestrictions on entering the EU, the
OL,10,FNCA added.
